message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Pre-vaccine sentinel antibodies predict blunted vaccine responses"
abstract: "Code associated with the study 'Pre-vaccine sentinel antibodies predict blunted vaccine responses.' This repository contains the analysis pipeline and supporting scripts used to process antibody measurements and model vaccine response outcomes reported in the publication."
type: software
version: "v1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21079244"
